#: src/tabs/about.cpp:29
msgid "About the Injection Frontend (SKIF):"
msgstr "About the Boardin' Frontend (SKIF):"

#: src/tabs/about.cpp:33
msgid ""
"You are looking at the Special K Injection Frontend app, commonly shortened "
"as 'SKIF'. This app injects Special K into any games launched from it, or "
"even into games that are already running!"
msgstr ""
"Ye be lookin' at the Special K Injection Frontend app, commonly called "
"'SKIF' by the crew. This app sends Special K aboard any games launched from "
"it, or even aboard games already under sail!"

#: src/tabs/about.cpp:36
msgid ""
"The frontend also provides convenient alternative launch options, shortcuts "
"to useful resources, and a few other helpful things."
msgstr ""
"The frontend also offers handy alternative launch options, shortcuts to "
"useful charts, an' a few other helpful trinkets."

#: src/tabs/about.cpp:62
msgid "Beginner's Guide to Special K (SK):"
msgstr "Greenhorn's Guide to Special K (SK):"

#: src/tabs/about.cpp:66
msgid ""
"Lovingly referred to as the Swiss Army Knife of PC gaming, Special K does a "
"bit of everything. It is best known for fixing and enhancing graphics, its "
"many detailed performance analysis and correction mods, and a constantly "
"growing palette of tools that solve a wide variety of issues affecting PC "
"games."
msgstr ""
"Lovingly known as the Swiss Army Knife o' PC gamin', Special K does a bit o' "
"everythin'. It be best known fer fixin' an' polishin' graphics, its many "
"detailed performance analysis an' correction mods, an' an ever-growin' chest "
"o' tools that mend all manner o' troubles plaguin' PC games."

#: src/tabs/about.cpp:72
msgid ""
"Among its main features are a latency-free borderless window mode, HDR "
"retrofit for SDR games, Nvidia Reflex in unsupported games, as well as "
"texture modding for players and modders alike. While not all features are "
"supported in all games, most DirectX 11 and 12 titles can make use of one or "
"more of its features."
msgstr ""
"Among its finest features be a latency-free borderless window mode, HDR "
"retrofit fer SDR games, Nvidia Reflex in games that lack it, an' texture "
"moddin' fer players an' modders alike. Not every feature works in every "
"game, but most DirectX 11 an' 12 titles can make use o' one or more o' its "
"features."

