#: src/tabs/hardware.cpp:1039
msgid ""
"MPOs are additional dedicated hardware scanout planes enabling the GPU to "
"partially take over composition from the DWM. This allows games to bypass "
"the DWM in various mixed scenarios or window modes, eliminating the "
"presentation latency that would otherwise be incurred."
